        <span class="callout__quote" data-quote-id="great-wave" aria-hidden="true">“The deeper we look into the ordinary, the more extraordinary it becomes.”</span>
        <span class="callout__quote" data-quote-id="last-supper" aria-hidden="true">“Sometimes, a single moment changes not what we know, but everything we thought we understood.”</span>
        <span class="callout__quote" data-quote-id="the-kiss" aria-hidden="true">“Not everything that matters can be understood and not everything understood truly matters.”</span>
